Logical map of the note
The main implications can be kept in view as follows:
\[
\begin{aligned}
\text{standard smooth}
&\Longrightarrow
\Omega_{X/Y}\text{ locally free of the expected rank},\\
\text{flat + smooth fibers}
&\Longrightarrow
\text{standard smooth locally},\\
\text{standard smooth}
&\Longrightarrow
\text{square-zero lifting},\\
\text{finite presentation + square-zero lifting}
&\Longrightarrow
\text{smooth}.
\end{aligned}
\]
In relative dimension \(0\), smoothness becomes étaleness; imposing the monomorphism condition supplied by an immersion then forces the morphism to be an open immersion, as in Lemma 1.
